cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The AIV rubric: an open standard for AI answer-engine visibility"
message: "If you use this rubric, please cite it and state the rubric version."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  The AIV rubric and geo-score, its reference implementation: an open-source AI
  visibility (GEO) scorer for websites, by Jianrun Tech. Formerly geo-watch:
  geo-watch 0.1.0 merged into geo-score in 1.2.0, where it continues
  as levels 2 and 3 (citation checks through the AI engines' APIs).
